    "description": "Steve Schneider, principal bartender at New York’s Employees Only, has a long history with Margaritas. “I love Margaritas, I always have,” he says. “The Margarita has been a progression of my career, because in my 13 years behind the bar, it’s been the drink I’ve always had to make, even if it was in a shitty dive bar, with 18 beers on tap, making disco drinks.”\n\nNow, the mezcal-spiked version is a regular after-hours feature at EO, where the rest of the staff shares his love of the classic.",
